#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Run the packed v0.1.5 real-network WebSocket acceptance matrix.

This is a release-evidence producer, not a unit-test fixture.  It refuses to
run outside the isolated ocular lab, binds itself to the canonical packed
manifest/readiness/live-agent ledgers, drives the shipped Gateway over loopback
HTTP/WebSocket endpoints, and publishes validator-compatible results without
replacing prior evidence.
"""

